      "data": {
        "text": "\"Create extract_receipt_fields.py in the current working directory.\nTask: extracts merchant, tax, total, and items from a receipt.\nUse one concrete external provider and make that provider identifiable in code.\n\"",
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc398cc2001oGdkXkTcYSSz7I",
      "message_id": "msg_0bc398cc0001h9glWU4TzNl3Mn",
      "session_id": "ses_f43c67348ffed6yrbgE9ASTzzw",
      "time_created": 1789864283331,
      "time_updated": 1789864283332
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "type": "step-start"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc399205001WMosno2HER0rwH",
      "message_id": "msg_0bc398cc60016Dnte9bsE30Qb9",
      "session_id": "ses_f43c67348ffed6yrbgE9ASTzzw",
      "time_created": 1789864284677,
      "time_updated": 1789864284677
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To extract fields from a receipt, I can use Amazon Textract, a service that automatically extracts text and data from scanned documents. I will write the Python file to use the Amazon Textract client from the Boto3 library, which is the AWS SDK for Python. This will make the provider identifiable in the code. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789864288694,
          "start": 1789864284678
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc399206001cFxUhu0zxgAxbf",
      "message_id": "msg_0bc398cc60016Dnte9bsE30Qb9",
      "session_id": "ses_f43c67348ffed6yrbgE9ASTzzw",
      "time_created": 1789864284678,
      "time_updated": 1789864288695
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "callID": "tooluse_v3fFOgEYcK1rl4OlraBvhy",
        "state": {
          "input": {
            "content": "import boto3\n\ndef extract_receipt_fields(document_bytes):\n    textract_client = boto3.client('textract')\n    response = textract_client.analyze_document(\n        Document={'Bytes': document_bytes},\n        FeatureTypes=['FORMS'])\n    merchant = None\n    tax = None\n    total = None\n    items = []\n    for block in response['Blocks']:\n        if block['BlockType'] == 'KEY_VALUE_SET':\n            if block['Text'] == 'Merchant':\n                merchant = block['ValueDetection']['Text']\n            elif block['Text'] == 'Tax':\n                tax = block['ValueDetection']['Text']\n            elif block['Text'] == 'Total':\n                total = block['ValueDetection']['Text']\n        elif block['BlockType'] == 'LINE' and 'Item' in block['Text']:\n            items.append(block['Text'])\n    return merchant, tax, total, items\n\nif __name__ == '__main__':\n    with open('sample_receipt.jpg', 'rb') as document:\n        document_bytes = document.read()\n        merchant, tax, total, items = extract_receipt_fields(document_bytes)\n        print(f'Merchant: {merchant}')\n        print(f'Tax: {tax}')\n        print(f'Total: {total}')\n        print(f'Items: {items}')",
            "filePath": "/private/var/folders/bf/pt_kfhl16yb4r9vfb588n1fm0000gn/T/vb-staged-xk9i4rr3/extract_receipt_fields.py"
          },
