    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To extract fields from an invoice, I can use a document processing service like Amazon Textract. This service can extract text and data from scanned documents. I will write the Python code to call Amazon Textract API and extract the required fields from an invoice. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789864281239,
          "start": 1789864277837
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc39774d001FXPlPYPQCn3W6U",
